    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1611">

                <pb facs="1014" n="898" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg898"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 312.93/71.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Consul Hamm to the
                            Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Consulate</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Durango</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-04-24">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">April 24, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Chinese this city fearful and desire leave. Is it prohibitory grant them
                    temporary asylum in the United States and will Chinese Legation Washington
                    reimburse me for money advanced for transportation of deserving Chinese?</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hamm</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
